{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11234010.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11234010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11234010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1123401001:0":{"text":"지금 하쉬르는 뭘 하고 있을까요?","source_cn":"不知道，现在哈什尔在做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93B750C0930A0BE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1123401002:0":{"text":"맞아요, 마스터! 어서 가봐요!","source_cn":"是的！主人！我们快去看看吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEC10A0ECB82D0F18","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞아요, 마스터! 어서 가봐요!","female":"맞아요, 마스터! 어서 가봐요!","variant_male_record_index":"127664","variant_female_record_index":"127665","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11234030.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11234030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11234030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1123403001:0":{"text":"아니, 저건... 누군가 하쉬르를 공격하고 있어요!","source_cn":"不，那是……有人在攻击哈什尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x783DA0A646D31D55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1123403002:0":{"text":"마스터, 얼른 가서 도와줘야 해요!","source_cn":"主人，我们快去帮助他！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2F7412EA2AAFF41B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 얼른 가서 도와줘야 해요!","female":"마스터, 얼른 가서 도와줘야 해요!","variant_male_record_index":"127672","variant_female_record_index":"127673","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11234050.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11234050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11234050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1123405001:0":{"text":"흥, 지켜보겠다! 늙... 하쉬르!","source_cn":"哼，我会一直盯着你的！老……哈什尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB1E96BD84BB9CA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1123405002:0":{"text":"됐다, 쫓지 말거라.","source_cn":"算了，别追了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD20758828E23AFEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑嚎熊人乌泰":{"text":"우타이","source":"黑嚎熊人乌泰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:哈什尔":{"text":"하쉬르","source":"哈什尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11234060.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11234060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11234060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1123406001:1":{"text":"하쉬르 씨. 뭘 챙기고 계신 거예요?","source_cn":"哈什尔先生，你收拾这些是要做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EF4F30C3206FBD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123406002:1":{"text":"날씨가 좋을 때 여기를 떠나야지.","source_cn":"趁着天气不错，离开这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BCF36A5C6DA42E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1123406002":{"text":"날씨가 좋을 때 여기를 떠나야지.","source_cn":"趁着天气不错，离开这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BCF36A5C6DA42E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1123406003:1":{"text":"녀석들은 틀리지 않았어. 내가 문제인 게지.","source_cn":"他们没什么错，有问题的是我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF3A3E6E2FBE848C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123406005:1":{"text":"전통을 정말 어기면 안 되는 건가요?","source_cn":"传统真的是不可违背的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D222CA3EAF1D1E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1123406006:1":{"text":"너희는 아센 사막 출신이 아니니 이곳이 얼마나 잔인한지 모르겠지...","source_cn":"你们并非荒角沙漠之人，不会懂得这里有多残酷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DD5F92DB58BA71D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1123406007:1":{"text":"전통을 지켰기 때문에 블랙하울은 항상 위대할 수 있었다.","source_cn":"正是因为遵循传统，黑嚎才会一直伟大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC50344711C08D257","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1123406008:1":{"text":"노인은 스스로 부족을 떠나는 게 규칙이야. 지금까지 너무 나약하게 굴었군... 아무래도 조금 더 철저하게 행동해야겠어.","source_cn":"年老者自我放逐，这是铁律。我之前还是太过软弱了……现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B5DAAF040E93510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1123406009:1":{"text":"비켜라. 짐을 정리해야겠구나.","source_cn":"你们站开一些，我要整理行李了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x465D945A4E07CD32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1123406009":{"text":"비켜라. 짐을 정리해야겠구나.","source_cn":"你们站开一些，我要整理行李了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x465D945A4E07CD32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1123406010:1":{"text":"그래. 일찍 챙기면 일찍 떠날 수 있겠지.","source_cn":"那就这样吧，早点收拾完，早点离开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98575D8310AE9575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"도와줄게","source_cn":"我们帮你","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE134DC020BBE4E5E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"도와줄게","female":"도와줄게","variant_male_record_index":"64918","variant_female_record_index":"64919","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"방금 저 두 사람 때문인가?","source_cn":"因为刚才那两个人吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF14AEB5D9CF44AB7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"방금 저 두 사람 때문인가?","female":"방금 저 두 사람 때문인가?","variant_male_record_index":"64914","variant_female_record_index":"64915","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1123406004:1":{"text":"나에겐 전통을 어기고 명예를 땅에 처박는 게 더 위험한 일일세.","source_cn":"对我来说真正的危险是违背传统，名誉扫地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B74D5AA703E59D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"얼른 떠나, 여긴 너무 위험해","source_cn":"你离开这里很危险","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x20CADB24578D5292","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"얼른 떠나, 여긴 너무 위험해","female":"얼른 떠나, 여긴 너무 위험해","variant_male_record_index":"64916","variant_female_record_index":"64917","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:哈什尔":{"text":"하쉬르","source":"哈什尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11234070.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11234070","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11234070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1123407001:1":{"text":"떠날 시간이군. 내가 가져갈 수 있는 게 얼마나 있지?","source_cn":"是时候离开了，能跟我上路的东西有多少呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4A57D0DA6174131","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123407002:1":{"text":"이렇게까지 단호하게 구는 이유가 뭐죠? 치피는 이해가 안 돼요...","source_cn":"满满还是不理解……为什么一定要这么坚决呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AB34622B71DAEA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123407003:1":{"text":"자원이 부족했던 사막의 개척 시대에 모든 부족은 생존이라는 문제에 맞닥뜨렸지. 자원에 한계가 있었기 때문에 전투가 끊이지 않았어.","source_cn":"在沙漠的拓荒时代，因为资源贫瘠，生存是各个氏族必须面对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D29A6226CADA9CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1123407004:1":{"text":"승리한 부족은 살아남고, 패배한 부족은 도태되는 시절이었다. 인의와 도덕 따위는 모두 사치였고, 부족의 전투력만이 생존의 밑바탕이었지.","source_cn":"赢的氏族活下来，输的氏族被淘汰，一切仁义道德都是多余的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B6A38ED269A0747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123407005:1":{"text":"크루거는 그 시절을 겪지 않았기 때문에 이게 무슨 의미인지 몰라.","source_cn":"克鲁格并未经历过那个年代，所以他根本不懂那意味着什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D11613B8C24A9AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_recor